            ("Elena Silverstream", "The champion fisher who caught a Sea Serpent with a bamboo rod. She now serves as the Dockmaster of Sapphire Harbor."),
            ("Gideon Stoneheart", "A dwarf who single-handedly held the Eastern Gate against a goblin horde for three days. His statue stands in the center of Stonehold."),
            ("Aria Moonshadow", "An elven ranger who tracked and killed the Shadow Stalker that terrorized Silverbark for a century. She now leads the rangers of the Whispering Woods."),
