            ("The Leviathan", "An ancient sea serpent that predates the dragons. It sleeps beneath the ocean floor and its dreams cause tidal waves. It is said to be the size of a mountain range."),
            ("The Abyssal Horror", "A creature from the deepest ocean trenches, where no light penetrates. It has never been seen clearly."),
            ("The Sea Witch", "A mysterious figure who lives in a coral castle beneath the waves. She controls sea creatures and is said to grant boons to sailors who make offerings."),
            ("The Drowned Legion", "The ghosts of a sunken army that still marches across the ocean floor. They are searching for their lost general, who went down with their flagship."),
            ("The Coral Dragon", "A dragon that adapted to living underwater. Its scales are made of living coral and its breath weapon is a stream of superheated water."),
